## Description

The Progress 94 cargo spacecraft, carrying about three tons of food, fuel, and supplies, launched from the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Kazakhstan at 7:59am ET. Docking is set for 9:34am Tuesday, March 24. More... https://t.co/gxwxacbI0w https://t.co/7tUIev8Uy8

